From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:42:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Shape outside list markers when painted instead of keeping
 them

Every list item with an outside marker kept a shaped and broken layout
of its bullet or number, though only paint reads it. Items now record
the scale, and paint shapes the marker from the item's style with the
contexts that rebuild evicted text. Paint output is unchanged.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
 src/layout/list.rs  | 60 +++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------
 src/node/element.rs |  7 ++++--
 src/node/mod.rs     |  1 +
 src/node/text.rs    | 18 +++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 51 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

